  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAmountOfRevenueFromContractsWithCustomersTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: left; text-indent: -24px"&gt;※１　顧客との契約から生じる収益&lt;/p&gt;
